  "description": "重启按钮 + 科技感开机动画 for DeepSeek Harness Desktop (Windows): a 重启 button in the title menu bar, and a WMI restarter that survives the app's own Job Object. · 桌面端标题栏一键重启，冷启动换成科技感动画。",
  "type": "module",
